      "payload": {
        "progress": "oxfmt DEFERRED, Biome kept for format/format:check. Evidence: oxfmt is 0.60.0 (pre-1.0 by the project's own semver; latest resolvable under the 3-day release-age gate is 0.59.0), changelog shows a breaking config change as recently as v0.33 and new *experimental* .svelte support in v0.49 (~2.5mo before this pass) -- still actively evolving. Concretely tested (bunx oxfmt@0.59.0 --check, non-destructive) against this repo's own src/**/tests/**: 11/238 files differ from Biome's current output, and the diffs are NOT cosmetic -- e.g. src/web/views/tree.ts gets a materially different reflow of tagged-template HTML (html`...`) content, indentation and line-wrapping change throughout. That fails the bar of 'a clean, reviewable result' -- adopting now would churn real files unpredictably for marginal benefit. oxfmt DOES format JSON/JSONC fine (not a blocker on its own)."
      },
      "at": "2026-07-24T13:01:21.202Z"
